      <header class="page-header">
        <h1>One-Arm Hang Guide: Step-by-Step Progression</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">A step-by-step plan that takes you from a two-arm base to holding your full bodyweight from one hand.</p>
      </header>
    </div>
    <article class="article">
      <div class="article-meta">
        <a href="/about/" class="author-link">
          <span class="author-avatar">DH</span>
          <span>DeadHangs Team</span>
        </a>
        <span class="meta-sep">·</span>
        <span class="updated-date">Updated October 30, 2026</span>
        
